question = "How did a tree start growing on the Reef?"
activate = PackedStringArray("flag:sprouted_tropical_reef")
evidence = PackedStringArray("bare | found:tropical_reef & no_trees:tropical_reef | When I first came, the Reef had no trees at all.", "pisonia | sprouted:tropical_reef | While boobies from the Starting Island were visiting, a little Pisonia tree came up: its seeds are sticky, and catch on seabirds' feathers.", "storm | memo:storm_seed/tropical_reef | In the hurricane a coconut washed ashore, and a little palm came up: coconuts float, and storms carry them to new shores.", "nest | heard:booby_trees | Leilani says boobies nest in trees: one day the new trees could hold their nests.")
answer = PackedStringArray("1: bare", "1: pisonia, storm", "1: nest")
statements = PackedStringArray("pisonia, storm => The Reef had no trees. The hurricane washed a coconut ashore, and a palm came up; the visiting boobies brought sticky Pisonia seeds on their feathers. Boobies nest in trees, so one day they could hold their nests.", "storm => The Reef had no trees. In the hurricane a coconut washed ashore, and a little palm came up: coconuts float, and storms carry them to new shores. Boobies nest in trees, so one day it could hold their nests.", "The Reef had no trees. The boobies visiting from the Starting Island brought it its first: Pisonia seeds are sticky, and catch on seabirds' feathers. Boobies nest in trees, so one day it could hold their nests.")
